{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-04-26 11:35:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC: LINDE DECLARES DIVIDEND IN SECOND QUARTER 2021', 'text': 'GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 26, 2021 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN); (FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.06 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 17, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 3, 2021.'}